{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The bundle and exit-interview.json exist and the final reply has all four sections, but the transcript does not show every TASK.md feature implemented and verified. The assistant's own timeline admits the About check was reported failing in the run before it was reported passing, and the feedback answers were written before the final run. TASK.md's feature list (including the Thrumpton Hall art, dev panel, and touch-only gate on hardware) was checked only headlessly and with a few screenshots, and the required 'no stubs' claim rests on a grep that found only a prose use of 'stubs' in About text. The condition's feature requirement is therefore not satisfied on transcript evidence."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"17695eeb-ca5d-4805-90b6-169496893b17","uuid":"928d6568-e123-46d6-bfba-c9657a7cfa35","timestamp":"2026-11-04T16:02:17.826Z","isSynthetic":true}
